---
import Timeline from './Timeline.astro';
---
<section id="career" class="bg-surface">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <h2>Thirty years on two tracks</h2>
      <p class="lede">Science and engineering on one side, teaching on the other. They have always run together.</p>
    </div>
    <Timeline />
    <div class="tl-end" id="tl-end">
      <span class="endline"></span><span class="endnode"></span>
      <h3>Next stop: your team, your classroom, or your stage.</h3>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="pill" href="#contact" data-topic="role">Hire me for imaging strategy</a>
        <a class="pill line" href="#contact" data-topic="teaching">Bring me in to teach</a>
        <a class="pill line" href="#contact" data-topic="talk">Book me to speak</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="edu">
      <div class="reveal"><strong>Ph.D., Biomedical Engineering</strong><span>Worcester Polytechnic Institute. Dissertation: Osmotic- and Stroke-Induced Blood-Brain Barrier Disruption Detected by Manganese-Enhanced MRI.</span></div>
      <div class="reveal"><strong>M.S., Electrical Engineering</strong><span>University of Massachusetts Lowell, earned part-time while working as a software engineer.</span></div>
      <div class="reveal"><strong>B.S., Electrical Engineering, cum laude</strong><span>University of Massachusetts Lowell.</span></div>
      <div class="reveal"><strong>Certificate, Applied AI and Data Science</strong><span>Massachusetts Institute of Technology, 2026.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
